Emergent-specific components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The frontend dev-dependency `@emergentbase/visual-edits` and the Emergent-managed
Google OAuth flow (`EMERGENT_AUTH_URL`) are tied to the Emergent platform. They
are optional for self-hosting and can be removed / replaced (see README).
